      "sourceHash": "fc6ec6d77cd604213cd2eaa56536a27b1d8f8aa3fc3011bc8256e2ea88233d49",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Each run of detection processes frames over a short period, and produces one detection result.",
      "contextAfter": "For example, when [`isCameraLensSmudgeDetectionEnabled`](avcapturedevice/iscameralenssmudgedetectionenabled.md) is set to `true` and `detectionInterval` is set to 1 minute, detection runs once per minute, and updates [`AVCaptureCameraLensSmudgeDetectionStatus`](avcapturecameralenssmudgedetectionstatus.md).",
      "documentTitle": "setCameraLensSmudgeDetectionEnabled(:detectionInterval:)",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "`detectionInterval`을 사용해 각 감지 실행 사이의 시간 간격을 지정합니다.",
