      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "For example, when [`isCameraLensSmudgeDetectionEnabled`](avcapturedevice/iscameralenssmudgedetectionenabled.md) is set to `true` and `detectionInterval` is set to 1 minute, detection runs once per minute, and updates [`AVCaptureCameraLensSmudgeDetectionStatus`](avcapturecameralenssmudgedetectionstatus.md).",
      "normalizedSource": "For example, when [`isCameraLensSmudgeDetectionEnabled`](avcapturedevice/iscameralenssmudgedetectionenabled.md) is set to `true` and `detectionInterval` is set to 1 minute, detection runs once per minute, and updates [`AVCaptureCameraLensSmudgeDetectionStatus`](avcapturecameralenssmudgedetectionstatus.md).",
      "sourceHash": "28ff6a7001d728764f989a8f5baa41a1b105e994418ff602a5e7ae540188b720",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Use `detectionInterval` to specify the interval time between each run of detections.",
      "contextAfter": "If `detectionInterval` is set to `kCMTimeInvalid`, detection runs only once after the session starts.",
      "documentTitle": "setCameraLensSmudgeDetectionEnabled(:detectionInterval:)",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "예를 들어 [`isCameraLensSmudgeDetectionEnabled`](avcapturedevice/iscameralenssmudgedetectionenabled.md)이 `true`로 설정되고 `detectionInterval`이 1분으로 설정되면 감지는 1분마다 한 번 실행되어 [`AVCaptureCameraLensSmudgeDetectionStatus`](avcapturecameralenssmudgedetectionstatus.md)를 업데이트합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
