    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0004",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If `detectionInterval` is set to `kCMTimeInvalid`, detection runs only once after the session starts.",
      "normalizedSource": "If `detectionInterval` is set to `kCMTimeInvalid`, detection runs only once after the session starts.",
      "sourceHash": "da88cc3162bcd832031bd77e258bdc41a0c85c6e75dedd225da581d710e68e30",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "For example, when [`isCameraLensSmudgeDetectionEnabled`](avcapturedevice/iscameralenssmudgedetectionenabled.md) is set to `true` and `detectionInterval` is set to 1 minute, detection runs once per minute, and updates [`AVCaptureCameraLensSmudgeDetectionStatus`](avcapturecameralenssmudgedetectionstatus.md).",
