      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0009",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "[`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md) throws an `NSInvalidArgumentException` if the [`isCameraLensSmudgeDetectionSupported`](avcapturedevice/format/iscameralenssmudgedetectionsupported.md) property on the current active format returns `false`.",
      "normalizedSource": "[`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md) throws an `NSInvalidArgumentException` if the [`isCameraLensSmudgeDetectionSupported`](avcapturedevice/format/iscameralenssmudgedetectionsupported.md) property on the current active format returns `false`.",
