      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If `detectionInterval` is set to `kCMTimeZero`, detection runs continuously.",
      "contextAfter": "Enabling detection requires a lengthy reconfiguration of the capture render pipeline, so you should enable detection before calling [`startRunning()`](avcapturesession/startrunning().md) or within [`beginConfiguration()`](avcapturesession/beginconfiguration().md) and [`commitConfiguration()`](avcapturesession/commitconfiguration().md) while running.",
      "documentTitle": "setCameraLensSmudgeDetectionEnabled(:detectionInterval:)",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "[`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md)는 현재 활성 형식에서 [`isCameraLensSmudgeDetectionSupported`](avcapturedevice/format/iscameralenssmudgedetectionsupported.md) 속성이 `false`를 반환하면 `NSInvalidArgumentException`을 발생시킵니다.",
